{"prompt": {"messages": [{"role": "system", "content": "You are a helpful assistant that translates Java code to Python 3 code. The code should reads and writes I/O from the console."}, {"role": "user", "content": "Translate the following Java 8 code to Python 3 code. The code reads and writes I/O from the console. Your translated code should have the exact same functionality as the given code, meaning that it should have the same output for any given input.\nPrint your translated code and also the confidence score you give to your translation. The confidence score should be a number between 0 and 1. The format of the output should be:\n<translated_code>\n<your_translated_code>\n</translated_code>\n<confidence>\n<your_confidence_score>\n</confidence>\nDo not provide any other text or markdown fences.\n\nHere is the original Java 8 code you have to translate:\n<original_code>\nimport java.util.Scanner;\nimport java.io.*;\n\npublic class Main {\n    public static void main(String[] args) {\n        Scanner sc = new Scanner(System.in);\n        int n = sc.nextInt();\n        int mod = sc.nextInt();\n        long[][] dp = new long[n][n * n + 5];\n        dp[0][0] = 1;\n        for (int i = 1; i < n; i++) {\n            for (int j = 0; j < dp[0].length; j++) {\n                for (int cnt = 0; cnt <= i; cnt++) {\n                    if (j - cnt >= 0) {\n                        dp[i][j] += dp[i - 1][j - cnt];\n                        dp[i][j] %= mod;\n                        if (dp[i][j] == 0) dp[i][j] += mod;\n                    }\n                }\n            }\n        }\n        long[][] sums = new long[dp.length][dp[0].length];\n        for (int i = 0; i < dp.length; i++) {\n            long sum = 0;\n            for (int j = 0; j < dp[0].length; j++) {\n                sum += dp[i][j];\n                sum %= mod;\n                if (sum == 0) sum += mod;\n                sums[i][j] = sum;\n            }\n        }\n        long[][] ncr = new long[501][501];\n        ncr[0][0] = 1;\n        for (int i = 1; i < ncr.length; i++) {\n            ncr[i][0] = 1;\n            for (int j = 1; j < ncr[0].length; j++) {\n                ncr[i][j] = (ncr[i - 1][j] + ncr[i - 1][j - 1]) % mod;\n                if (ncr[i][j] == 0) ncr[i][j] += mod;\n            }\n        }\n        long res = 0;\n        for (int i = n - 2; i >= 0; i--) {\n            int cnt = n - i;\n            int pre = n - cnt;\n            long com = (ncr[n][pre] * fact(pre)) % mod;\n            if (com == 0) com += mod;\n            long sum = 0;\n            for (int dif = 1; dif < cnt; dif++) {\n                for (int inv = dif; inv < dp[0].length; inv++) {\n                    if (dp[cnt - 1][inv] == 0) break;\n                    if (inv - dif - 1 < 0) continue;\n                    long x = dp[cnt - 2][inv];\n                    long y = sums[cnt - 2][inv - dif - 1];\n                    x *= y;\n                    x %= mod;\n                    if (x == 0) x += mod;\n                    sum += x * (cnt - dif);\n                    sum %= mod;\n                }\n            }\n            res += sum * com;\n            res %= mod;\n            if (res == 0) res += mod;\n        }\n        System.out.println(res % mod);\n    }\n    static long fact(int n) {\n        long f = 1;\n        for (int i = 2; i <= n; i++) f = f * i % mod;\n        return f;\n    }\n}\n</original_code>\n"}], "temp": 0, "sample_size": 1, "logprobs": true, "model": "deepseek/deepseek-v4-flash"}, "response": {"samples": [{"content": "<translated_code>\nimport sys\n\ndef main():\n    data = sys.stdin.read().strip().split()\n    if not data:\n        return\n    n = int(data[0])\n    mod = int(data[1])\n    \n    # dp array: n rows, n*n+5 columns\n    dp = [[0] * (n * n + 5) for _ in range(n)]\n    dp[0][0] = 1\n    \n    for i in range(1, n):\n        for j in range(len(dp[0])):\n            for cnt in range(i + 1):\n                if j - cnt >= 0:\n                    dp[i][j] += dp[i - 1][j - cnt]\n                    dp[i][j] %= mod\n                    if dp[i][j] == 0:\n                        dp[i][j] += mod\n    \n    # sums array: cumulative sums of dp rows\n    sums = [[0] * len(dp[0]) for _ in range(len(dp))]\n    for i in range(len(dp)):\n        s = 0\n        for j in range(len(dp[0])):\n            s += dp[i][j]\n            s %= mod\n            if s == 0:\n                s += mod\n            sums[i][j] = s\n    \n    # ncr table up to 500\n    ncr = [[0] * 501 for _ in range(501)]\n    ncr[0][0] = 1\n    for i in range(1, 501):\n        ncr[i][0] = 1\n        for j in range(1, 501):\n            ncr[i][j] = (ncr[i - 1][j] + ncr[i - 1][j - 1]) % mod\n            if ncr[i][j] == 0:\n                ncr[i][j] += mod\n    \n    # factorial function using mod from outer scope\n    def fact(k):\n        f = 1\n        for i in range(2, k + 1):\n            f = (f * i) % mod\n            if f == 0:\n                f += mod\n        return f\n    \n    res = 0\n    for i in range(n - 2, -1, -1):\n        cnt = n - i\n        pre = n - cnt\n        com = (ncr[n][pre] * fact(pre)) % mod\n        if com == 0:\n            com += mod\n        s = 0\n        for dif in range(1, cnt):\n            for inv in range(dif, len(dp[0])):\n                if dp[cnt - 1][inv] == 0:\n                    break\n                if inv - dif - 1 < 0:\n                    continue\n                x = dp[cnt - 2][inv]\n                y = sums[cnt - 2][inv - dif - 1]\n                x = (x * y) % mod\n                if x == 0:\n                    x += mod\n                s += x * (cnt - dif)\n                s %= mod\n        res += s * com\n        res %= mod\n        if res == 0:\n            res += mod\n    \n    print(res % mod)\n\nif __name__ == \"__main__\":\n    main()\n</translated_code>\n<confidence>\n0.95\n</confidence>", "token_logprobs": [-1.3351351299206726e-05, 0.0, 0.0, -6.663577369181439e-05, -0.12761534750461578, -9.298280929215